      "soft_memo": "<div>Understand the basic principles of radiating systems and antenna theory. Design and analysis of various kinds of antennas: such as dipole, wire, micro-strip, and array antennas, and describe the methods of characterizing these systems. An antenna design practice including simulation, fabrication, and measurement tasks will be assigned to solidify the learning experience. Familiar Circuit Design Tools:\u000b1. Schematic / PCB Layout tool: OrCAD, Pads,polarsi9000\u000b2. EM simulation tool: ADS, CST.HFSS\u000b3. Circuit tool: ADS.\u000b4. 3D/2D tool: creo 2.0, auto-cad, core draw</div>\n",
